=2 Walkthrough
* You cannot start this quest if you have another {q:Weapon Skill Quest|WSNM|Weapon Skill Quest} active. You must return to the person that gave said quest and quit it to start another.
* Speaking with {n:Jaucribaix} will grant you the key item {k:Weapons Training Guide|Weapon training guide} as well as the {p:Tachi of Trials}. You will need to break the latent on the {p:Tachi of Trials} before completing the rest of the quest.

:* Breaking the Latent

::* With the {p:Tachi of Trials} equipped in your Main hand, fight experience-yielding mobs ("Incredibly Easy Prey" or higher) and perform {p:Weapon Skills|Category:Weapon Skills} or close {p:Skillchains|Category:Skillchain} to accumulate 300 "Trial Points".

|^Skillchain Level|Points
|No Skillchain|5
|Level 1|7
|Level 2|9
|Level 3|11

::* You know you have enough points when the latent breaks. You will know it is done when the weapon's elemental resistances disappear from your active resistances (colored dots below the gear grid, but above the selected item description). **The item's description text will never change**.

!Broken Latent.png||
* Trade the {p:Tachi of Trials} back to {n:Jaucribaix}. This will give you the key item {k:Map to the Annals of Truth}. You will be instructed to travel to {z:Kuftal Tunnel}.

* Unity Warp(125) brings you relatively close, and at item level you will have no issues kiting everything on your way to spawn the NM.

* Take {i:Silent Oil|Silent Oil|4165} and {i:Prism Powder|Prism Powder|4164} with you and head to {z:Kuftal Tunnel}. When you enter the tunnel, follow the path to the first junction and head north. Continue north through the large tunnel until you come to (I-5) and then head southeast. The ??? to spawn the NM is in this tunnel at (L-7).

* This fight is against {m:Kettenkaefer}, a beetle. It is weak to {p:Ice} and {p:Light} attacks. Once you kill it, re-examine the ??? to receive the key item {k:Annals of Truth}.

* Go back and speak with {n:Jaucribaix} to receive your reward.

